{
  "_comment": [
    "Shared derivation vectors for the Anlagen-Topologie-Read-Model (AE1).",
    "Consumed by Go (edge-app/core/internal/topology), TS",
    "(frontend/portal/src/topology.ts) and Java (services/api .../topology)",
    "test suites so all three produce the SAME node set from the SAME input",
    "(the jcs-vectors.json precedent). Each case: input.entities carry already-",
    "RESOLVED capability roles + live values; expected is the derived topology.",
    "The Go and TS outputs are byte-identical; the Java output is the same",
    "structure. See topology-read-model.md.",
    "",
    "default_role_cases pin the MAPPING itself (entity type + category + channel",
    "+ charge-point connection -> role), which the derive cases cannot: they",
    "carry roles that are ALREADY resolved. That mapping is where the three",
    "twins drift most easily, so it gets its own vectors (Cockpit Phase 1 / C2)."
  ],
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "cases": [
    {
      "name": "pilot-deye-fronius-gridmeter",
      "note": "AE1 acceptance: hybrid contributes PV+Speicher; PV aggregates hybrid+producer; grid is the maßgebliche meter.",
      "input": {
        "entities": [
          {
            "id": "A", "type": "battery-hybrid", "label": "Deye SUN-30K", "category": "storage", "health": "ok",
            "capabilities": [
              { "channel": "soc_pct", "role": "storage", "primary": true, "value": 62.5 },
              { "channel": "battery_power_kw", "role": "storage", "primary": true, "value": 12.4 },
              { "channel": "pv_power_kw", "role": "pv", "primary": false, "value": 18.9 }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "B", "type": "producer", "label": "Fronius Eco 27", "category": "producer", "health": "ok",
            "capabilities": [
              { "channel": "pv_power_kw", "role": "pv", "primary": false, "value": 44.2 }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "C", "type": "grid-meter", "label": "Netzanschluss", "category": "meter", "health": "ok",
            "capabilities": [
              { "channel": "power_kw", "role": "grid", "primary": true, "value": -49.7 }
